mage-office: xlsx sheets that declare no paper size are exported with none.

A <pageSetup> without paperSize (or no <pageSetup> at all) means "the printer's paper" to Excel.
The importer gave such sheets Letter and the exporter then wrote paperSize="1" on every sheet. The
importer now leaves the default size and records the page style in the document InteropGrabBag;
the exporter omits paperSize while the style still has that size (a paper the user picks since is
written as usual).

